<section class="section-accordion" id="common-questions">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section__inner">
      <div class="section__media">
        <div class="section__image" style="background-image: url(https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/temp/section-img-2.jpg);"></div><!-- /.section__image -->
      </div><!-- /.section__media -->

      <div class="section__accordion">
        <div class="section__accordion-head">
          <h3>Common Questions</h3>
        </div><!-- /.section__accordion-head -->

        <div class="section__accordion-image hidden-xs">
          <img src="https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/temp/background-3.png" alt="Background image">
        </div><!-- /.section__accordion-image -->

        <div class="section__accordion-image hidden visible-xs-block">
          <img src="https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/temp/background-3-mobile.png" alt="Background image">
        </div><!-- /.section__accordion-image -->

        <div class="accordion accordion--primary js-accordion">
          <div class="accordion__section">
            <a href="#" class="accordion__head" aria-controls="is-active">
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="“true”">
                <img src="https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/svg/ico-accordion-1.svg" alt="Icon in accordion">
              </span><!-- /.accordion__icon -->

              <h2>How do I apply to the College?</h2>

              <span class="accordion__arrow">
                <img src="https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/svg/accordion-arrow.svg" alt="Accordion arrow">
              </span>
            </a>

            <div class="accordion__body" aria-hidden="true" aria-expanded="false">
              <p>We offer multiple admissions pathways depending on a variety of factors, such as military service, immigration status, program of study, prior college credits, and more. Find the application process that best matches your situation.</p>

              <span>Quick Links</span>

              <a href="/admissions/" class="accordion__link">Admissions</a>
            </div><!-- /.accordion__body -->
          </div><!-- /.accordion__section -->

          <div class="accordion__section">
            <a href="#" class="accordion__head">
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="“true”">
                <img src="https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/svg/ico-accordion-2.svg" alt="Icon in accordion">
              </span><!-- /.accordion__icon -->

              <h2>Can I afford Middlesex College?</h2>

              <span class="accordion__arrow">
                <img src="https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/svg/accordion-arrow.svg" alt="Accordion arrow">
              </span>
            </a>

            <div class="accordion__body">
              <p>The amount you pay depends on whether you are a resident of Middlesex County, and more importantly, your financial aid and scholarships. Almost all of our students qualify for substantial financial aid packages and scholarship awards. Students who come from families making less than $65,000 can even attend for free.</p>

              <span>Quick Links</span>

              <a href="/funding-your-education/" class="accordion__link">Funding Your Education</a>

              <a href="/funding-your-education/types-of-aid/" class="accordion__link">Types of Aid</a>
            </div><!-- /.accordion__body -->
          </div><!-- /.accordion__section -->

          <div class="accordion__section">
            <a href="#" class="accordion__head">
              <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="“true”">
                <img src="https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/svg/ico-accordion-3.svg" alt="Icon in accordion">
              </span><!-- /.accordion__icon -->

              <h2>What can I study?</h2>

              <span class="accordion__arrow">
                <img src="https://middlesexcollege.edu/wp-content/themes/middlesex-college/assets/images/svg/accordion-arrow.svg" alt="Accordion arrow">
              </span>
            </a>

            <div class="accordion__body">
              <p>We offer more than 80 degree and certificate programs of study. All of our associate degree programs can be completed in two years. Most allow you to transfer to a four-year college or university to work toward a bachelor’s degree; some make it possible for you to enter a specific field upon graduation. We also offer short term certificate programs that can prepare you for the workplace or advance in your current career.</p>

              <span>Quick Links</span>

              <a href="/academics/degrees/" class="accordion__link">Degrees and Certificates</a>
            </div><!-- /.accordion__body -->
          </div><!-- /.accordion__section -->
        </div><!-- /.accordion js-accordion -->

      </div><!-- /.section__accordion -->

    </div><!-- /.section__inner -->
  </div><!-- /.shell -->
</section><!-- /.section-accordion -->

